  "question": "Show that $2 \\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac{2x}{1 - x^2}\\right) = \\sin^{-1}\\left(\\frac{4x(1 - x^2)}{(1 + x^2)^2}\\right)$, given $|x| < 1$.",
